@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000
@itemId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@taskId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000020

### 新增护理任务，替换真实衣物 ID
POST {{baseUrl}}/care-tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "item_id": "{{itemId}}",
  "kind": "wash",
  "status": "pending",
  "due_on": "2026-11-20",
  "notes": "按衣物洗护标签处理"
}

### 待完成任务
GET {{baseUrl}}/care-tasks?status=pending

### 任务详情
GET {{baseUrl}}/care-tasks/{{taskId}}

### 更新为已完成，不自动恢复衣物可用状态
PUT {{baseUrl}}/care-tasks/{{taskId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "item_id": "{{itemId}}",
  "kind": "wash",
  "status": "done",
  "due_on": "2026-11-20",
  "notes": "已完成护理"
}

### 删除任务
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/care-tasks/{{taskId}}
